  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Intergovernmental Coordination Group for the Tsunami and Other Coastal Hazards Warning System for the Caribbean and Adjacent Regions (ICG/CARIBE EWS) is currently comprised of 32 Member States and 16 territories in the Caribbean and Adjacent regions . Through its Caribbean Tsunami Information Center (CTIC), the ICG/CARIBE EWS and UNESCO/IOC will work towards awarding, within the Framework of the Tsunami Ready Programme, the Tsunami Ready recognition to an increased number of Caribbean Member States and communities.</narrative>
